            "notes": "### \u2694\ufe0f ITEMS\n\n| Item | Description |\n| ---- | ------------ |\n| [Dae-Hyun\u2019s Detonator](item_cf3e51e1-12c7-4d92-a68b-7742f98fe8fa) | **IMPORTANT ITEM** - This makes your **Ultimate** so much more effective, as long as it explodes in the air |\n| [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) | Good Survivability item for [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6), as she already has quite a bit of armor |\n| [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) | Ability Power (20%) |\n\n#### Survivability Items\n- [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) is very good against a [Sigma](hero_646d9571-c40a-4403-b6c1-fb67adb6112d), [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b), [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) or any other hero that can **Stun**.\n- [Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131) against beams, such as [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0), [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0) or [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed).\n- [Refraction Armor](item_dd020802-8d00-489d-93e0-930b80e31144) same as [Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131).\n\n#### Optional items:\n- [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) \n- [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295)\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n- [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7)",
